      "end_raw": "00:04.20",
      "start_ms": 0,
      "end_ms": 4200,
      "text": "Low-angle macro shot tracking through an impenetrable, menacing thicket of frozen blackthorn briars encrusted with frost.",
      "line_number": 14,
      "duration_ms": 4200
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP013_B002",
      "episode_id": "EP013",
      "file_index": 1,
      "scene_id": "EP013_S01",
      "block_type": "SOUND_FX",
      "label_raw": "SOUND FX",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:00.00",
      "end_raw": "00:04.00",
      "start_ms": 0,
      "end_ms": 4000,
      "text": "Whistling winter wind and an ominous low brass drone.",
      "line_number": 18,
      "duration_ms": 4000
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP013_B003",
      "episode_id": "EP013",
      "file_index": 2,
      "scene_id": "EP013_S01",
      "block_type": "CAMERA",
      "label_raw": "CAMERA",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:04.20",
      "end_raw": "00:07.00",
      "start_ms": 4200,
      "end_ms": 7000,
      "text": "Wide shot looking down from the stone terrace. Gerald and Clarissa stand elevated on the balustrade, while Juliana, Alexander in handcuffs, and the Constable stand before the dense briar garden.",
      "line_number": 22,
      "duration_ms": 2800
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP013_B004",
      "episode_id": "EP013",
      "file_index": 3,
      "scene_id": "EP013_S01",
      "block_type": "ACTION",
      "label_raw": "ACTION",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:05.10",
      "end_raw": "00:07.00",
      "start_ms": 5100,
      "end_ms": 7000,
      "text": "Alexander turns toward Juliana, his manacled hands trembling as he grips her arm.",
      "line_number": 26,
      "duration_ms": 1900
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP013_B005",
      "episode_id": "EP013",
      "file_index": 4,
      "scene_id": "EP013_S01",
      "block_type": "DIALOGUE",
      "label_raw": "ALEXANDER (Pleading, Agonized)",
      "speaker": "ALEXANDER",
      "delivery": [
        "Pleading",
        "Agonized"
      ],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:05.40",
      "end_raw": "00:10.20",
      "start_ms": 5400,
      "end_ms": 10200,
      "text": "\"Juliana, look at those thorns. You cannot do this.\"",
      "line_number": 30,
      "duration_ms": 4800
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP013_B006",
      "episode_id": "EP013",
      "file_index": 5,
      "scene_id": "EP013_S01",
      "block_type": "CAMERA",
      "label_raw": "CAMERA",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:07.00",
      "end_raw": "00:10.80",
      "start_ms": 7000,
      "end_ms": 10800,
      "text": "Medium close-up of Alexander and Juliana facing each other, his chained wrists held between them.",
      "line_number": 34,
      "duration_ms": 3800
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP013_B007",
      "episode_id": "EP013",
      "file_index": 6,
      "scene_id": "EP013_S01",
      "block_type": "CAMERA",
      "label_raw": "CAMERA",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:10.80",
      "end_raw": "00:14.20",
      "start_ms": 10800,
      "end_ms": 14200,
      "text": "Close-up on Juliana's hooded face, her eyes filled with resolute sorrow.",
      "line_number": 38,
      "duration_ms": 3400
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP013_B008",
      "episode_id": "EP013",
      "file_index": 7,
      "scene_id": "EP013_S01",
      "block_type": "DIALOGUE",
      "label_raw": "JULIANA (Quiet, Unwavering)",
      "speaker": "JULIANA",
      "delivery": [
        "Quiet",
        "Unwavering"
      ],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:12.40",
      "end_raw": "00:13.80",
      "start_ms": 12400,
      "end_ms": 13800,
      "text": "\"I must.\"",
      "line_number": 42,
      "duration_ms": 1400
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP013_B009",
      "episode_id": "EP013",
      "file_index": 8,
      "scene_id": "EP013_S01",
      "block_type": "CAMERA",
      "label_raw": "CAMERA",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:14.20",
      "end_raw": "00:18.80",
      "start_ms": 14200,
      "end_ms": 18800,
      "text": "Close-up on Alexander, his combat scar stark against his pained expression.",
      "line_number": 46,
      "duration_ms": 4600
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP013_B010",
      "episode_id": "EP013",
      "file_index": 9,
      "scene_id": "EP013_S01",
      "block_type": "DIALOGUE",
      "label_raw": "ALEXANDER (Terrified for Her)",
      "speaker": "ALEXANDER",
      "delivery": [
        "Terrified for Her"
      ],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:14.40",
      "end_raw": "00:17.30",
      "start_ms": 14400,
      "end_ms": 17300,
      "text": "\"They will tear your hands apart.\"",
      "line_number": 50,
      "duration_ms": 2900
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP013_B011",
      "episode_id": "EP013",
      "file_index": 10,
      "scene_id": "EP013_S01",
      "block_type": "CAMERA",
      "label_raw": "CAMERA",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:18.80",
      "end_raw": "00:21.00",
      "start_ms": 18800,
      "end_ms": 21000,
      "text": "Low-angle shot looking up at Gerald and Clarissa leaning over the stone balustrade, smirking down with cruel amusement.",
      "line_number": 54,
      "duration_ms": 2200
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP013_B012",
      "episode_id": "EP013",
      "file_index": 11,
      "scene_id": "EP013_S01",
      "block_type": "CAMERA",
      "label_raw": "CAMERA",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:21.00",
      "end_raw": "00:24.20",
      "start_ms": 21000,
      "end_ms": 24200,
      "text": "Close-up of Juliana looking up into Alexander's eyes with tender courage.",
      "line_number": 58,
      "duration_ms": 3200
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP013_B013",
      "episode_id": "EP013",
      "file_index": 12,
      "scene_id": "EP013_S01",
      "block_type": "DIALOGUE",
      "label_raw": "JULIANA (Soft, Reassuring)",
      "speaker": "JULIANA",
      "delivery": [
        "Soft",
        "Reassuring"
      ],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:22.00",
      "end_raw": "00:23.90",
      "start_ms": 22000,
      "end_ms": 23900,
      "text": "\"I will be fine.\"",
      "line_number": 62,
      "duration_ms": 1900
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP013_B014",
      "episode_id": "EP013",
      "file_index": 13,
      "scene_id": "EP013_S01",
      "block_type": "DIALOGUE",
      "label_raw": "ALEXANDER (Desperate, Fierce)",
      "speaker": "ALEXANDER",
      "delivery": [
        "Desperate",
        "Fierce"
      ],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:24.20",
      "end_raw": "00:28.40",
      "start_ms": 24200,
      "end_ms": 28400,
      "text": "\"I would rather face the gallows than watch you hurt yourself for me.\"",
      "line_number": 66,
      "duration_ms": 4200
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP013_B015",
      "episode_id": "EP013",
      "file_index": 14,
      "scene_id": "EP013_S01",
      "block_type": "CAMERA",
      "label_raw": "CAMERA",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:24.20",
      "end_raw": "00:28.50",
      "start_ms": 24200,
      "end_ms": 28500,
      "text": "Two-shot framing Alexander leaning down toward Juliana, fighting against his bonds.",
      "line_number": 70,
      "duration_ms": 4300
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP013_B016",
      "episode_id": "EP013",
      "file_index": 15,
      "scene_id": "EP013_S01",
      "block_type": "CAMERA",
      "label_raw": "CAMERA",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:28.50",
      "end_raw": "00:29.90",
      "start_ms": 28500,
      "end_ms": 29900,
      "text": "Close-up of Gerald chuckling smugly on the terrace above, crossing his arms.",
      "line_number": 74,
      "duration_ms": 1400
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP013_B017",
      "episode_id": "EP013",
      "file_index": 16,
      "scene_id": "EP013_S01",
      "block_type": "CAMERA",
      "label_raw": "CAMERA",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:29.90",
      "end_raw": "00:36.80",
      "start_ms": 29900,
      "end_ms": 36800,
      "text": "Tight close-up of Juliana gently clasping Alexander's handcuffed hands, gazing up at him with unyielding love.",
      "line_number": 78,
      "duration_ms": 6900
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP013_B018",
      "episode_id": "EP013",
      "file_index": 17,
      "scene_id": "EP013_S01",
      "block_type": "DIALOGUE",
      "label_raw": "JULIANA (Emotional, Devoted)",
      "speaker": "JULIANA",
      "delivery": [
        "Emotional",
        "Devoted"
      ],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:30.80",
      "end_raw": "00:35.80",
      "start_ms": 30800,
      "end_ms": 35800,
      "text": "\"You stood beside me when everyone else abandoned me. I will not abandon you now.\"",
      "line_number": 82,
      "duration_ms": 5000
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP013_B019",
      "episode_id": "EP013",
      "file_index": 18,
      "scene_id": "EP013_S01",
      "block_type": "ACTION",
      "label_raw": "ACTION",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:36.20",
      "end_raw": "00:39.50",
      "start_ms": 36200,
      "end_ms": 39500,
      "text": "Juliana releases his hands and turns toward the briar thicket. Alexander stretches out his chained hands, attempting to hold her back, but the Constable restrains him.",
      "line_number": 86,
      "duration_ms": 3300
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP013_B020",
      "episode_id": "EP013",
      "file_index": 19,
      "scene_id": "EP013_S01",
      "block_type": "CAMERA",
      "label_raw": "CAMERA",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:36.80",
      "end_raw": "00:39.80",
      "start_ms": 36800,
      "end_ms": 39800,
      "text": "Medium shot behind Juliana as she walks toward the vast expanse of frozen briars.",
      "line_number": 90,
      "duration_ms": 3000
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP013_B021",
      "episode_id": "EP013",
      "file_index": 20,
      "scene_id": "EP013_S01",
      "block_type": "DIALOGUE",
      "label_raw": "CLARISSA (O.S.) (Mocking, Vindictive)",
      "speaker": "CLARISSA",
      "delivery": [
        "Mocking",
        "Vindictive"
      ],
      "offscreen": "O.S.",
      "start_raw": "00:37.00",
      "end_raw": "00:38.20",
      "start_ms": 37000,
      "end_ms": 38200,
      "text": "\"Careful, sister.\"",
      "line_number": 94,
      "duration_ms": 1200
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP013_B022",
      "episode_id": "EP013",
      "file_index": 21,
      "scene_id": "EP013_S01",
      "block_type": "CAMERA",
      "label_raw": "CAMERA",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:39.80",
      "end_raw": "00:41.60",
      "start_ms": 39800,
      "end_ms": 41600,
      "text": "Low-angle shot of Clarissa smirking down over the carved stone balustrade.",
      "line_number": 98,
      "duration_ms": 1800
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP013_B023",
      "episode_id": "EP013",
      "file_index": 22,
      "scene_id": "EP013_S01",
      "block_type": "DIALOGUE",
      "label_raw": "CLARISSA (Cruel, Sarcastic)",
      "speaker": "CLARISSA",
      "delivery": [
        "Cruel",
        "Sarcastic"
      ],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:39.90",
      "end_raw": "00:41.50",
      "start_ms": 39900,
      "end_ms": 41500,
      "text": "\"That garden has swallowed better women than you.\"",
      "line_number": 102,
      "duration_ms": 1600
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP013_B024",
      "episode_id": "EP013",
      "file_index": 23,
      "scene_id": "EP013_S01",
      "block_type": "CAMERA",
      "label_raw": "CAMERA",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:41.60",
      "end_raw": "00:45.80",
      "start_ms": 41600,
      "end_ms": 45800,
      "text": "Medium close-up of Gerald leaning against the balcony beside Clarissa, wearing an arrogant smirk.",
      "line_number": 106,
      "duration_ms": 4200
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP013_B025",
      "episode_id": "EP013",
      "file_index": 24,
      "scene_id": "EP013_S01",
      "block_type": "DIALOGUE",
      "label_raw": "GERALD (Condescending, Arrogant)",
      "speaker": "GERALD",
      "delivery": [
        "Condescending",
        "Arrogant"
      ],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:41.80",
      "end_raw": "00:45.50",
      "start_ms": 41800,
      "end_ms": 45500,
      "text": "\"Perhaps the beggar's wife will finally learn what her new life is worth.\"",
      "line_number": 110,
      "duration_ms": 3700
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP013_B026",
      "episode_id": "EP013",
      "file_index": 25,
      "scene_id": "EP013_S02",
      "block_type": "ACTION",
      "label_raw": "ACTION",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:45.80",
      "end_raw": "00:47.00",
      "start_ms": 45800,
      "end_ms": 47000,
      "text": "Juliana drops to her knees in front of the frozen blackthorn branches, steadying her trembling breath.",
      "line_number": 121,
      "duration_ms": 1200
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP013_B027",
      "episode_id": "EP013",
      "file_index": 26,
      "scene_id": "EP013_S02",
      "block_type": "CAMERA",
      "label_raw": "CAMERA",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:45.80",
      "end_raw": "00:47.00",
      "start_ms": 45800,
      "end_ms": 47000,
      "text": "Medium shot of Juliana kneeling on the frozen soil at the edge of the briars.",
      "line_number": 125,
      "duration_ms": 1200
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP013_B028",
      "episode_id": "EP013",
      "file_index": 27,
      "scene_id": "EP013_S02",
      "block_type": "CAMERA",
      "label_raw": "CAMERA",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:47.00",
      "end_raw": "00:50.00",
      "start_ms": 47000,
      "end_ms": 50000,
      "text": "Medium shot of Alexander lunging forward with chained hands raised high, roaring in fury as the Constable grabs him.",
      "line_number": 129,
      "duration_ms": 3000
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP013_B029",
      "episode_id": "EP013",
      "file_index": 28,
      "scene_id": "EP013_S02",
      "block_type": "DIALOGUE",
      "label_raw": "ALEXANDER (Screaming, Panicked)",
      "speaker": "ALEXANDER",
      "delivery": [
        "Screaming",
        "Panicked"
      ],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:47.20",
      "end_raw": "00:48.80",
      "start_ms": 47200,
      "end_ms": 48800,
      "text": "\"Juliana, stop!\"",
      "line_number": 133,
      "duration_ms": 1600
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP013_B030",
      "episode_id": "EP013",
      "file_index": 29,
      "scene_id": "EP013_S02",
      "block_type": "SOUND_FX",
      "label_raw": "SOUND FX",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:47.80",
      "end_raw": "00:49.20",
      "start_ms": 47800,
      "end_ms": 49200,
      "text": "Rattling of heavy iron chains.",
      "line_number": 137,
      "duration_ms": 1400
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP013_B031",
      "episode_id": "EP013",
      "file_index": 30,
      "scene_id": "EP013_S02",
      "block_type": "ACTION",
      "label_raw": "ACTION",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:50.00",
      "end_raw": "00:53.00",
      "start_ms": 50000,
      "end_ms": 53000,
      "text": "Juliana crawls forward on all fours, lowering her head under the jagged, arching thorns.",
      "line_number": 141,
      "duration_ms": 3000
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP013_B032",
      "episode_id": "EP013",
      "file_index": 31,
      "scene_id": "EP013_S02",
      "block_type": "CAMERA",
      "label_raw": "CAMERA",
